# Local-only development configuration template. Copy to `.env` and fill in real values;
# `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Nothing here is read by the shipped app at build time. Per docs/TECHNICAL_PLAN.md and
# docs/CLOUD_AND_HINGLISH_DECISION.md, the Gemini API key is never embedded in the APK — Firebase
# AI Logic proxies it server-side, and the actual Firebase project configuration lives in
# google-services.json (also gitignored, added to app/ at Stage 1, never committed). A raw
# GEMINI_API_KEY has no legitimate place in this repo at any stage.
#
# Stage 0A (current) needs none of this — the app has no network code yet. These are placeholders
# for Stage 1 local dev tooling only (e.g. scripting `firebase` CLI commands, or setting an App
# Check debug token for local runs per IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md §4 item 1's "documented debug
# provider for local dev only"). Leave unset until Stage 1 actually needs them.

# Firebase project ID, for local `firebase` CLI usage only (not read by the app).
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=

# App Check debug token for local development builds only — never used in release builds,
# never a substitute for Play Integrity. See IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md §4 item 1.
# APP_CHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN=
